          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : " practice, in %@"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment" : "What a hub chip is FOR, appended to its name for a reader the glyph tells nothing: %s = the language being practiced. Leads with a space — it finishes the chip's own name rather than standing as a sentence."
