        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ new words"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment" : "Fresh cards spelled out with their noun, for the one shape home.tally.newCards cannot cover on its own: the round names nothing else, so a bare count needs the word it is counting (\"neue Wörter\") rather than a nominalized adjective standing alone. No count-of-one form — a round with only fresh cards and only one is not a real shape."
    },
